    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/83/Alraune.png/revision/latest?cb=20220825061053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alraune\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/83/Alraune.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20220825061053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"316\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alraune.png\" data-image-key=\"Alraune.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alraune.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b4/Alraune_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20220825204451\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alraune 2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b4/Alraune_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20220825204451\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"252\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alraune 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Alraune_2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alraune_2.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>一种可以伪装成人类女性的伏击捕食者，正如在  <a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Exiled_Warrior\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade: Exiled Warrior\">女皇之刃：放逐的战士</a>  第八章：老兵佣兵。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131125\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.